Boundary note:
  cloudflare-dns-ops = IMPLEMENTATION + OPERATIONS (zone setup, record management, proxied
  vs DNS-only decisions, DNSSEC enablement, Foundation DNS, secondary DNS, 1.1.1.1, DNS
  Firewall, API/Terraform, analytics read-ops).
  dns-network-ops = ARCHITECTURE + CROSS-PLATFORM + CONCEPTS (resolution flow, DNSSEC
  design, platform selection, hybrid design). No content duplication: cloudflare-dns-ops
  covers the Cloudflare-specific implementation surface; dns-network-ops covers the
  conceptual and comparative layer and routes to vendor skills.
  Broader Cloudflare platform (WAF, CDN, Zero Trust, Workers, R2, Pages) is out of scope
  for this DNS-focused skill; noted in When not to use.

